  "description": "Survival analysis for .NET, at lifelines parity: the Kaplan-Meier survival function with Greenwood variance and log-log confidence intervals, the Nelson-Aalen cumulative hazard, and the two-sample log-rank test. Right-censored data, ties handled as the references handle them. Spans in, curves and numbers out, and no dependencies outside Lodestar.",
